    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προ-κρῐτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for preference</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκριτικόν, τό,</span>
			<i>ground</i> or <i>cause for preference,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ap.Ty.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>heralding a crisis</i> in disease, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παροξυσμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					5.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρητικός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1141a
			</span></i>.</div>
